course: dictionary
lesson: 13893
title: Lacking
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Lacking means not having something you need, or not having enough of it. «The tent was lacking a peg, so it kept falling down.» The tent needed a peg and did not have one. Lacking in something means having too little of it: «The soup was lacking in salt.»
explain: Look for the clue in the sentence. Ask: what is missing? If the sentence tells you what is missing, you have found the meaning. «The team was sadly lacking in speed» means the team did not have enough speed.
explain: In maths, lacking tells you how big a shortage is. «The class needs 24 chairs but has 19.» The class is lacking 5 chairs. To find how many are lacking, take away: needed minus have, so 24 − 19 = 5.
explain: In science, plants lacking water wilt, and a diet lacking vitamins can make people ill. In each case, something needed is missing. Check your meaning by swapping in "short of" or "missing": if it still makes sense, you are right.
fact: Lacking means not having something you need, or not having enough of it.
fact: Lacking in something means having too little of it, as in «lacking in sleep».
fact: Lack is the verb, and its forms are lack, lacks, lacked and lacking.
fact: «Sadly lacking» means there is much too little of something.
fact: In maths, the amount lacking = needed − have.
exercise: «The cake was lacking in sugar, so it tasted bland.» What does lacking in mean here? | Having a pink colour | *Having too little sugar | Having too much sugar | Having no cake at all
exercise: «The class needs 24 chairs but has 19.» How many chairs are lacking? | *5 | 43 | 19 | 6
exercise: «The old bike was lacking a seat.» What is missing from the bike? | Wheels | A bell | *A seat | Lights
test: «The sandwich was lacking in filling.» What does lacking in mean? | Having plenty of filling | *Having too little filling | Having a funny shape | Having no bread
test: A school needs 40 books and has 31. How many books are lacking? | 71 | 31 | *9 | 11
exam: Mia says, «The plant is lacking water.» What does this tell us? | The plant has too much water | *The plant does not have the water it needs | The plant is very tall | The plant is lacking a pot
